  "vv58:0.4": "8. Paṭhamasūcivimānavatthu 944. ",
  "vv58:1.1": "‘‘Uccamidaṃ maṇithūṇaṃ vimānaṃ, ",
  "vv58:1.2": "samantato dvādasa yojanāni; ",
  "vv58:1.3": "Kūṭāgārā sattasatā uḷārā, ",
  "vv58:1.4": "veḷuriyathambhā rucakatthatā subhā. ",
  "vv58:2.1": "945. ‘‘Tatthacchasi pivasi khādasi ca, ",
  "vv58:2.2": "dibbā ca vīṇā pavadanti vagguṃ; ",
  "vv58:2.3": "Dibbā rasā kāmaguṇettha pañca, ",
  "vv58:2.4": "nāriyo ca naccanti suvaṇṇachannā. ",
  "vv58:3.1": "946. ‘‘Kena tetādiso vaṇṇo ",
  "vv58:3.2": "…pe… ",
  "vv58:3.3": "vaṇṇo ca te sabbadisā pabhāsatī’’ti. ",
  "vv58:4.1": "948. So devaputto attamano ",
  "vv58:4.2": "…pe… ",
  "vv58:4.3": "yassa kammassidaṃ phalaṃ. ",
  "vv58:5.1": "949. ‘‘Yaṃ dadāti na taṃ hoti, ",
  "vv58:5.2": "Yañceva dajjā tañceva seyyo; ",
  "vv58:5.3": "Sūci dinnā sūcimeva seyyo. ",
  "vv58:6.1": "950. ‘‘Tena metādiso vaṇṇo ",
  "vv58:6.2": "…pe… ",
  "vv58:6.3": "vaṇṇo ca me sabbadisā pabhāsatī’’ti. ",
  "vv58:7.1": "Paṭhamasūcivimānaṃ aṭṭhamaṃ. "
}
